6
00:12:29,846 --> 00:12:33,776
{\be1\fs34.56\fad(355,355)}Hans Müller     {\fs28.8}Organ Tuner

7
00:12:38,446 --> 00:12:42,366
{\be1\fs34.56\fad(355,355)}Doumoto Genya     {\fs28.8}Pianist & Doumoto Kazuki's Son

8
00:13:29,056 --> 00:13:32,976
